# S3d: TIMED arm of the paired ABAB on coding prompts (audits OFF; both arms carry the in-trace sampler hang fix): the arm, the combined best plus the traced carry copies, second of two. Arms alternate A B A B in this one image, each after its own
# all-four reset, same admission order: A = c2-packed-tp4-best-strace, B = c2-packed-tp4-best-strace-tpub; the pair differs in QWEN_FAST_TP4_TRACED_PUBLISH alone (test_tp4_tpub_window).
# The tests: warmup, coding and long_real_text (the lone-user, sequential steps the lever speeds up) and concurrent4_code_equal (four real-code prompts of 4k: the lever must cost nothing there), 800 tokens out each.
# Read: the '[SEQUENTIAL]' step lines (the per-step wall: about 75 ms at rows=4 today, the arm target about 15 ms less, an estimate from the 16.4 ms median carry enqueue of run N4b) and the
# '[PACKED-PHASE]' lines of the four-user test (unchanged within noise). Judge the arms PAIRED per step and per round, never by unpaired medians; check the load average around the run (a busy host
# skews host phases 10 to 20 percent) and repeat before believing a small gap.
# Then offline: python scripts/ci/speed_window_compare.py <A results> <B results> --users 0,1,2,3 --position-keyed --strict-concurrent-prefixes (exit 0 identical): the lever copies the same bytes to
# the same addresses, so every user's text and accepted-prefix sequence must be IDENTICAL between A and B, and B's texts must equal S1's audited ones.
# OPTIONAL, run only after S2a..S2c all completed: a hang on a timed arm is a finding, and the control carries the same hang fix.
# Duration (estimate): reset 1 to 3 min, engine build 10 to 20 min, the four tests 15 to 35 min: 60 min.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/tpub window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/tpub and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image a build-only job (C2_ACTIONS=build, no card opened) builds from this branch while
# production serves; a later commit of scripts needs a new build and tag. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-tpub-1 is a PLACEHOLDER the driver may substitute.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-tpub-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-best-strace-tpub
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,long_real_text,concurrent4_code_equal
